message: "If you use this orthography, please cite it as below."
title: "Ukrainian Latynytsia: A Phonemic Latin Orthography for the Ukrainian Language"
abstract: >-
  A phonemic Latin orthography for the Ukrainian language, designed as a
  structural mirror of the Ukrainian Cyrillic alphabet. It establishes a strict
  one-to-one mapping between phonemes and graphemes with zero digraphs for native
  Ukrainian phonemes: the trema marks palatalized and iotated vowels, the
  apostrophe marks the palatalization of consonants, and the hacek marks the
  three sibilants c, s, z. A structural, apolitical proposal fixed for priority
  of authorship.
